<div class="container">
    <div class="content-title">
        <text class="title">Router Transition · API and parameters (6)</text>
    </div>
    <list class="scroll-area">
        <list-item class="litem" style="height:205px;">
            <text class="box-title">edge：不传 animation</text>
            <text class="tip">不传 animation 成员：应瞬间切换、无动效，导航必须正常</text>
            <div class="op-row">
                <input class="opBtn" type="button" value="播放" onclick="play('router_edge_no_anim')" />
            </div>
            <div class="pf-row">
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{naPassColor}};" type="button" value="pass" onclick="togglePass('router_edge_no_anim')" />
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{naFailColor}};" type="button" value="fail" onclick="toggleFail('router_edge_no_anim')" />
            </div>
        </list-item>
        <list-item class="litem" style="height:205px;">
            <text class="box-title">edge：animation 传 null</text>
            <text class="tip">animation=null：非对象，应降级为无动效、瞬间切换</text>
            <div class="op-row">
                <input class="opBtn" type="button" value="播放" onclick="play('router_edge_anim_null')" />
            </div>
            <div class="pf-row">
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{anPassColor}};" type="button" value="pass" onclick="togglePass('router_edge_anim_null')" />
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{anFailColor}};" type="button" value="fail" onclick="toggleFail('router_edge_anim_null')" />
            </div>
        </list-item>
        <list-item class="litem" style="height:205px;">
            <text class="box-title">edge：animation 非对象</text>
            <text class="tip">animation='fade'（字符串）：应降级为无动效、瞬间切换</text>
            <div class="op-row">
                <input class="opBtn" type="button" value="播放" onclick="play('router_edge_anim_not_object')" />
            </div>
            <div class="pf-row">
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{noPassColor}};" type="button" value="pass" onclick="togglePass('router_edge_anim_not_object')" />
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{noFailColor}};" type="button" value="fail" onclick="toggleFail('router_edge_anim_not_object')" />
            </div>
        </list-item>
        <list-item class="litem" style="height:205px;">
            <text class="box-title">edge：type 非法</text>
            <text class="tip">type="fade_x"：应降级为无动效（引擎打 WARN），导航必须正常</text>
            <div class="op-row">
                <input class="opBtn" type="button" value="播放" onclick="play('router_edge_bad_type')" />
            </div>
            <div class="pf-row">
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{btPassColor}};" type="button" value="pass" onclick="togglePass('router_edge_bad_type')" />
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{btFailColor}};" type="button" value="fail" onclick="toggleFail('router_edge_bad_type')" />
            </div>
        </list-item>
        <list-item class="litem" style="height:205px;">
            <text class="box-title">edge：type 缺省</text>
            <text class="tip">有 duration 但没有 type 成员：应降级为无动效、瞬间切换</text>
            <div class="op-row">
                <input class="opBtn" type="button" value="播放" onclick="play('router_edge_type_missing')" />
            </div>
            <div class="pf-row">
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{tmPassColor}};" type="button" value="pass" onclick="togglePass('router_edge_type_missing')" />
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{tmFailColor}};" type="button" value="fail" onclick="toggleFail('router_edge_type_missing')" />
            </div>
        </list-item>
        <list-item class="litem" style="height:205px;">
            <text class="box-title">edge：router.replaceUrl</text>
            <text class="tip">改用 replaceUrl 触发 scale 动效：表现应与 replace 一致（约 800ms）</text>
            <div class="op-row">
                <input class="opBtn" type="button" value="播放" onclick="play('router_edge_replace_url')" />
            </div>
            <div class="pf-row">
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{ruPassColor}};" type="button" value="pass" onclick="togglePass('router_edge_replace_url')" />
                <input class="pfBtn" style="background-color:{{ruFailColor}};" type="button" value="fail" onclick="toggleFail('router_edge_replace_url')" />
            </div>
        </list-item>
    </list>
    <div class="bottom-bt">
        <input type="button" value="back" class="button" onclick="backClicked" />
    </div>
</div>
